    "tips": [
      "was/were = estado (onde, como). Ação = past simple.",
      "were só com you, we, they. O resto é was.",
      "Pergunta com was/were NÃO leva did: Were you tired?",
      "-ed só ganha sílaba extra depois de t ou d: wanted, needed, started.",
      "Revise os irregulares em famílias: bought, brought, thought · drank, swam, rang.",
      "did / didn't + verbo na forma BASE: I didn't go, Did you see?",
      "Consoante + y vira -ied: study → studied. Vogal + y: play → played.",
      "Marcadores de passado: yesterday, last night, last week, two days ago."
    ]
